# https://www.okx.com/es-ar/help/wallet-transfer-problems
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okex.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oklink.com
# Narrow aliases: current www.okx.com CNAME and previously observed SR hostname.
# Do not route all okpool.top, cloudflare.net or shared CDN IPs as OKX.
DOMAIN,awscn.okpool.top
DOMAIN,www.okx.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
